    </item>
    <item>
      <title>About</title>
      <link>//localhost:1313/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 16 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>//localhost:1313/about/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;about-me&#34;&gt;&#xA;  About Me&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#about-me&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Hi, I&amp;rsquo;m &lt;strong&gt;Piotr Szponder&lt;/strong&gt;, a passionate Data &amp;amp; AI Engineer with a love for turning complex data into actionable insights and building intelligent systems that make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-i-do&#34;&gt;&#xA;  What I Do&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#what-i-do&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I specialize in:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Engineering&lt;/strong&gt;: Building robust data pipelines, ETL processes, and data infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Machine Learning &amp;amp; AI&lt;/strong&gt;: Developing and deploying ML models for various applications&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Technologies&lt;/strong&gt;: Working with modern cloud platforms and distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software Development&lt;/strong&gt;: Creating scalable applications and tools&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;my-journey&#34;&gt;&#xA;  My Journey&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#my-journey&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;My journey in technology has been driven by curiosity and a desire to solve complex problems. I enjoy working at the intersection of data science, software engineering, and artificial intelligence, where I can leverage my technical skills to create meaningful solutions.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
